       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PB164FSK.
      *> kb/Work PB164 wave 2 - A FLOAT SORT KEY COMPARES BY ALGEBRAIC
      *> VALUE. 14.9.40.4 GR8 SENDS A NUMERIC KEY TO 8.8.4.2.4, WHICH
      *> COMPARES "WITH REGARD TO THE ALGEBRAIC VALUE OF THE OPERANDS"
      *> INDEPENDENT OF USAGE. THE KEY WINDOW HOLDS THE ITEM'S IEEE 754
      *> INTERCHANGE BYTES (13.18.60.4 GR13/GR15, THE WAVE-2 PIN), AND
      *> BIG-ENDIAN IEEE BYTES SORTED AS TEXT WOULD PUT EVERY NEGATIVE
      *> KEY AFTER EVERY POSITIVE ONE AND REVERSE THE NEGATIVES AMONG
      *> THEMSELVES - THE RUNTIME MUST DECODE THE WINDOW THROUGH THE
      *> KEY'S OWN PROFILE INTO ITS ALGEBRAIC DOUBLE LANE INSTEAD.
      *> RELEASED OUT OF ORDER WITH NEGATIVES ON BOTH SIDES OF ZERO,
      *> SO EITHER FAILURE SHAPE (NEG-LAST OR NEG-REVERSED) FLIPS THE
      *> OUTPUT ORDER.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT SWK ASSIGN TO "pb164-fsk-wk.dat".
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       SD SWK.
       01 SW-REC.
          05 SW-KEY USAGE COMP-2.
          05 SW-TAG PIC X(3).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 DONE-FLAG PIC X VALUE "N".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           SORT SWK ON ASCENDING KEY SW-KEY
               INPUT PROCEDURE IS FEED
               OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS DRAIN
           STOP RUN.
       FEED.
           MOVE 1000.25 TO SW-KEY
           MOVE "BIG" TO SW-TAG
           RELEASE SW-REC
           MOVE -50.5 TO SW-KEY
           MOVE "NEG" TO SW-TAG
           RELEASE SW-REC
           MOVE 7.5 TO SW-KEY
           MOVE "SML" TO SW-TAG
           RELEASE SW-REC
           MOVE -3.25 TO SW-KEY
           MOVE "NHI" TO SW-TAG
           RELEASE SW-REC
           MOVE 0 TO SW-KEY
           MOVE "ZER" TO SW-TAG
           RELEASE SW-REC.
       DRAIN.
      *> ASCENDING ALGEBRAIC ORDER: -50.5, -3.25, 0, 7.5, 1000.25.
           PERFORM UNTIL DONE-FLAG = "Y"
               RETURN SWK RECORD
                   AT END MOVE "Y" TO DONE-FLAG
                   NOT AT END DISPLAY SW-TAG
               END-RETURN
           END-PERFORM.
